---
import FeaturedInfographicPage from "../../components/FeaturedInfographicPage.astro";
import { incursionGuides } from "../../data/incursion";
import { machines, machineHref } from "../../lib/machines.mjs";
import MachineRating from "../../components/incursion/MachineRating.astro";
---

<FeaturedInfographicPage
  title="Incursion & Machine of War"
  description="Explore the Machines of War: my star ratings, adjustable abilities, and Incursion unlock guides."
  imageSrc="/images/incursion-mow.png"
  imageAlt="Incursion and Machine of War Infographic"
  infographicId="infographic"
  basicsTitle="Incursion & Machine of War Basics"
  basicsContent={`
## Event Timing

Incursion events run for a limited time and focus on a single **Machine of War (MoW)**.

## Choosing Your Machine of War

At the start of the event, you must select one Machine of War to pursue.

* Your choice is locked for the entire event.
* You cannot switch to a different Machine of War until the next Incursion event.
* Choosing carefully is important, especially for newer accounts with limited resources.

## Event Progression

Players battle through a series of stages that increase in difficulty.

Progression follows the rarity system:

* Common
* Uncommon
* Rare
* Epic
* Legendary
* Mythic

Higher difficulties offer greater rewards but require stronger rosters and more developed characters.

## Event Rewards

Incursion events are the primary way to unlock and improve Machines of War.

Rewards include:

* Machine of War shards used to unlock or ascend your chosen Machine of War
* Badges
* Orbs
* Components
* Other faction-specific upgrade materials

## What to Expect

Unlocking a Machine of War is achievable for most active players. Reaching higher ascension levels requires stronger rosters, efficient event progression, and participation across multiple Incursion cycles.

Because your Machine of War choice is locked for the event, it is worth reviewing the strengths and long-term value of each option before committing.

`}
>
  <section slot="guides" class="machine-guides" id="machines" aria-labelledby="machine-guides-heading">
    <div class="directory-heading"><div><span class="directory-eyebrow">The Machine of War roster</span><h2 id="machine-guides-heading">Choose your Machine of War</h2></div><span class="roster-count">{machines.length} MoWs</span></div>
    <p class="directory-intro">My ratings from the infographic above. Open a profile to explore its Active, Passive and Mythic abilities at any promotion, with independent ability levels from 1–60.</p>
    <div class="machine-guide-grid">
      {machines.map(machine => {
        const guide=incursionGuides.find(guide=>guide.slug===machine.slug);
        return <a class="machine-guide-link" href={machineHref(machine)}>
          <img class="machine-portrait" src={machine.portrait.src} width={machine.portrait.width} height={machine.portrait.height} alt={`${machine.name} portrait`} loading="lazy" />
          <div class="machine-card-copy"><span class="machine-faction">{machine.faction}</span><h3>{machine.name} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><div class="card-rating"><span>My Rating</span><MachineRating rating={machine.rating} /></div><p>{machine.verdict}</p><span class="profile-label">{guide ? 'Abilities + Unlock Guide' : 'Explore abilities'}</span></div>
        </a>;
      })}
    </div>
  </section>
</FeaturedInfographicPage>

<style>
  .machine-guides { padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 12px; background: #1e1e1e; scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
  .directory-heading { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.7rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }
  .directory-eyebrow { color:#c4b27c; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; font-size:.7rem; }
  .roster-count { color:#c4b27c; background:#28261d; border:1px solid #49412b; padding:.4rem .65rem; border-radius:5px; font-size:.75rem; }
  h2 { margin: .4rem 0 0; color: #d4af37; font-size:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,1.65rem); }
  .directory-intro { margin-bottom:1.5rem; max-width:850px; }
  .machine-guide-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .machine-guide-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.25rem; padding: 1.2rem; border: 1px solid #4e4425; border-radius: 9px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#252726,#151717); color: #f5f5f5; text-decoration: none; min-width:0; }
  .machine-guide-link:hover { border-color: #d4af37; }
  .machine-guide-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #d4af37; outline-offset: 4px; }
  .machine-portrait { width:88px; height:auto; object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius:6px; }
  .machine-card-copy { min-width:0; }
  .machine-faction { color:#aaa; font-size:.67rem; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  h3 { margin: .25rem 0 .6rem; color: #f2e5bd; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  h3 span { color:#d4af37; }
  .card-rating { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:.25rem .7rem; margin-bottom:.4rem; font-size:.85rem; }
  .card-rating > span:first-child { color:#aaa; font-size:.75rem; }
  p { margin: 0; color: #ccc; font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .profile-label { display:block; color:#cdbb83; font-size:.7rem; margin-top:.6rem; }
  @media (max-width: 850px) { .machine-guide-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .machine-guides { padding: 1rem; }
    .machine-guide-link { align-items: flex-start; gap: .8rem; }
    .machine-guide-link { padding:.9rem; }
    .machine-portrait { width:68px; }
  }
</style>
